            "review_title": "Review at The River Cafe",
            "review_text": "patinhongkong\nErmoupoli, Greece469 contributions\n0\nUnpretentious, but good food in a good location\nSep 2019\nThe River Cafe's location at the end of a car park is a bit off-putting, but it's very nice once you get there! This is a favourite spot for locals on the bank of the river so it was a bit noisy when we went for dinner with the after-work parties all unwinding, but lunch time a couple of days later was quiet enough. The food was surprisingly good and so was the service. The beer was served with a great chunk of ice in the glass -- not what we'd have chosen but it did the trick.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
