            "review_title": "Review at The River Cafe",
            "review_text": "Sreydy\nAldershot, United Kingdom939 contributions\n1\nNice quiet place by the river\nMar 2019\nHidden beautiful place by the river. It was quiet and peaceful. They got natural atmosphere which was very special since Saigon is a busy city and all shops and restaurants are in the buildings not easy to find natural place like here. Food was very local. There was a lunch set. It was great. They got pool table as well.\nWritten August 5, 2019",
