            "review_text": "Tim S\n2 contributions\n0\nLovely riverside cafe\nSep 2017 • Solo\nBeen here twice now - Saturday afternoon & a weekday evening. Busy with local people both times & deservedly so. Great, very tasty Vietnamese food at pretty reasonable prices.\n\nAmbience is nice with laid back vibes but the service is efficient & friendly. There was live music the evening I was there which was really great.\n\nWould definitely recommend over the more sterile, \"you could be anywhere\" riverside (hotel) bars just down the road. This place feels more authentic & is happily also much cheaper!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 6, 2017",
