            "review_title": "Review at The River Cafe",
            "review_text": "Shaun M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam299 contributions\n0\nReally poor meat dishes\nFeb 2017 • Friends\nI was looking forward to the visit to The River Cafe. Its a great location right on the river and is very rustic in appearance. It has a nice vietnamese restaurant feel and offers a small area for kids to play, and for live music to be played a few times a week. The bar sits right on the edge of the river as do many of the tables. \n\nThe food was really disappointing. The meat dishes we ordered were all really tough, and tasteless and were not able to be eaten. We wouldn't be going back especially when there is great tasting food being served everywhere else.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2017",
